,"stats":[12,13,70,64,72,73],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"6650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1018","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[12,13,70,64,72,73],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"6650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1024205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"琅琊临沂人，东汉末年名士，王祥、王览生父，汉末州郡屡次征辟、举孝廉，一概推辞，隐居乡里治学修身，不涉足乱世官场纷争。妻子朱氏（王览生母）性情偏狭，苛待前妻之子王祥。王融去世后，继母多次加害王祥，全靠幼子王览舍身护兄。奠定琅琊王氏孝友家风根基，二子王祥、王览凭德行名动天下，成为魏晋门阀道德标杆。","tc":"瑯琊臨沂人，東漢末年名士，王祥、王覽生父，漢末州郡屢次征辟、舉孝廉，一概推辭，隱居鄉里治學修身，不涉足亂世官場紛爭。妻子朱氏（王覽生母）性情偏狹，苛待前妻之子王祥。王融去世后，繼母多次加害王祥，全靠幼子王覽舍身護兄。奠定瑯琊王氏孝友家風根基，二子王祥、王覽憑德行名動天下，成為魏晉門閥道德標桿。","en":"A native of Linyi in Langya and a renowned scholar of the late Eastern Han dynasty, he was the father of Wang Xiang and Wang Lan. Repeatedly summoned by provincial and commandery authorities and nominated as Filial and Incorrupt, he declined all offers, living in seclusion in his hometown to cultivate his virtue and pursue scholarship without entering officialdom during turbulent times. His wife, Lady Zhu (mother of Wang Lan), was narrow-minded and mistreated his elder son Wang Xiang from his previous marriage. After Wang Rong's death, the stepmother repeatedly tried to harm Wang Xiang, who was saved only by his younger brother Wang Lan risking his life to protect him. He laid the foundation for the Langya Wang clan's tradition of filial piety and fraternal harmony, his two sons Wang Xiang and Wang Lan became famed throughout the realm for their virtue, serving as moral exemplars among Wei and Jin gentry clans.","jp":"琅邪臨沂の人。後漢末期の名士で、王祥・王覧の実父。漢末に州郡から度々辟召され、孝廉に挙げられたが、すべて辞退した。郷里に隠棲して学を修め身を慎み、乱世の官界の争いには関わらなかった。妻の朱氏（王覧の実母）は偏狭な性格で、先妻の子である王祥を苛遇した。王融の没後、継母は度々王祥を害そうとしたが、末子の王覧が身を挺して兄を守り抜いた。琅邪王氏の孝友の家風の礎を築き、二人の子である王祥と王覧はその徳行によって天下に名を馳せ、魏晋の門閥における道徳の鑑となった。","kr":"낭야 임의 사람으로, 동한 말의 명사이자 왕상과 왕람의 친부이다. 한말 주와 군에서 누차 징벽하고 효렴으로 천거했으나 일체 사양하였고, 향리에 은거하여 학문을 닦고 수신에 힘쓰며 난세의 관직 분쟁에 발을 들이지 않았다. 아내 주씨(왕람의 생모)는 성정이 편협하여 전처의 아들 왕상을 가혹하게 대했다. 왕융이 세상을 떠난 뒤 계모가 여러 차례 왕상을 해치려 했으나, 어린 아들 왕람이 몸을 던져 형을 지켜냈다. 낭야 왕씨 효우 가풍의 기틀을 다졌으며, 두 아들 왕상과 왕람은 덕행으로 천하에 이름을 떨쳐 위진 문벌의 도덕적 귀감이 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1029715","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"融","nameTc":"融","nameEn":"Rong","nameJp":"融","nameKr":"융","nameOther":"","word":"巨伟","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"王融","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"0","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1018","gender":"0","rule":"12","force":"13","wise":"70","politics":"64","charm":"72","will":"73","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"3/3/3/3/3/70/40/3","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1004705","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1002405","warSoulPoint":"2700","battleSoulPoint":"100","debateSoulPoint":"5500","strategy":"1007315","strategy2":"1009701","professions":"0/0/0/0/1/0/0/2/2/0/0/1/0/0/0/1/1/0/2/3/1/0/3/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"0","loyalty":"98","reputation":"6650","evaluate":"4000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"145","show":"184","death":"210","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1024205","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;13/1;59/1;40/2;37/2;45/2;23/0;19/0;8/0","fat